163
00:17:09,024 --> 00:17:11,024
かけがえのない家族を連れて
and bring irreplaceable families,

164
00:17:11,024 --> 00:17:13,024
この場所で逢えるといいな
it would be nice to meet here again.

165
00:17:37,424 --> 00:17:40,524
見つめられたら それだけで甘い 花 が 香り だす
Just with a single gaze, a sweet flower begins to fragrance.

166
00:17:40,524 --> 00:17:44,224
誰 に も 話し ちゃ いけない よ
You mustn't tell anyone.

167
00:17:44,224 --> 00:17:50,024
夢なら 覚めないで 桃源郷
If it's a dream, please don't wake me up, Peach Blossom Land.

168
